      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW AMALFI (8) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 525m behind High Five Indi (31.08) in a Grade 5. Placed at her previous run. Ready to return to form. WILE COYOTE (2) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 3 lengths (30.77) at this track in a Grade 5 over 525m. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Leading chance. AXEL'S RADAR (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (26.41) at Geelong behind Elevate in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Stalked the pace but found the line strongly. The form out of his last race has been franked. Hard to beat again. REUBEN HILL (5) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
